; DECnet-Start-Term - starts the maintenance login (dnmaint) of
; DECnet-Term. Install-DECnet-Term puts it here when the maintenance
; login is enabled; DECnet-Start runs it after dnetd.
; Settings: ENV:DECnet/maint-node, ENV:DECnet/maint-password
; Log: T:dnmaint.log. Stop it with: dnmaint STOP
If EXISTS ENV:DECnet/maint-password
  ; a second one ends at once ("already running")
  Run >NIL: dnmaint LOG=T:dnmaint.log
EndIf
